  <p>
    <span style="font-weight: 400;">Ertha’s globe consists of 350,000 HEX land plots, represented as NFTs. By owning a HEX land plot, you will get a cash-back for every transaction as a landowner.</span>
  </p>
  
  <p>
    <span style="font-weight: 400;">The game is designed to replicate a real-life environment, simulating the actions that people have to perform in order to earn a living.</span>
